      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Earth Mother Altar under the icy plain, rockman Gu Immortal Shi Zong declares willingness to join so the four races share fortune and woe. Hairy men of Lang Ya Sect, the allied snowman and rockman tribes, and Inkman City bind themselves with an ancient method that uses earth path to imprint information path dao marks. Fang Yuan joins as a Lang Ya Sect member. The pact holds rank eight battle strength through an immemorial rock dragon, with Fang Yuan’s upper extreme heavenly eagle also counted in other members’ minds.",
      "chapters": [
        1146
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_earth_mother",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_shi_zong",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "loc_inkman_city",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later calls the same pact the variant human alliance when he compares other agreements to it and notes that joining it used an earth path method for information path effects.",
      "chapters": [
        1161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "variant-human-alliance-name",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sixth Hair reminds Fang Yuan that they have already joined Northern Plains’ variant human alliance when arranging to buy snow lotus essence from the snowman tribe below the northern icy plain.",
      "chapters": [
        1441
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-title",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Fang Yuan’s engagement ceremony, almost all of the Northern Plains variant human alliance’s Gu Immortals join in, and his rank eight battle strength and status in that alliance are named as the reason.",
      "chapters": [
        1472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
